            "notes": "So Round 1 this is sort of the slow peace start since everything in the game is not over powered yet with abilities and other things.\n\nSo the first power would be is  [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a), Having Our Turn first as the first power makes sense to me because when team fights happen and everyone is very low, you have Nano to save everyone that is in your sight lines plus giving them a damage boost at the same time. \n\nAbilities for the start of the match \n1st you would go  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) for healing power in the biotic rifle.\n\n2nd you would is  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) for faster shooting unscope and scope \n\n3rd you would go  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) this is so when you are you don't have to beg for heals from other support the passive regeneration in the base game for supports will happen more quicky",
