            "notes": "Round 2 has happened let's say you have money and probably or maybe MVP to get some cash. This round should focus on the biotic rifle and upping the healing potent of the rifle.\n\nThis round you should get  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) so you as an Ana can heal your team very fast when they're are low health. \n\nAnother ability should get is  [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) this will help with the no scopes when healing allies or damaging the other opponents. Since the size of the projectile has been increased",
