            "notes": "Round 3 this is the fun part of the build in my eyes. You as ana get to have Nano yourself which is so good in so many ways.\n\nThis round for power you should  [My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521) this allows you have Nano yourself as well as the team. This can save you from many things like the normal game perk used to have but not anymore. \n\nAnother abilities you should get is  [Perfect Formula](item_7600cb93-dd32-4977-a88d-43e98d2c6927) this will increase Nano Boost for yourself and the person that you Nano. This is not for the other team mates I have to make sure that is the case but if I'm wrong, I'm wrong. Still get it for the damage boost/ reduction for you primary nano target\n\nAs well as in the buying stage you should sell  [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) me personally you shouldn't need it since you going to be pump heals anyway with  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) .",
