            "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:50:27.071219+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 4 this could be a tough one for me or anyone sometimes depending on the situation\n\nAbility wise you should really sell  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) since we are getting into the stage where green items are not really valuable. But if still don't comfortable about getting heals from the other support keep  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) .\n\nWhen you sell those two items you are going to buy  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) this will help the biotic rifle with healing when burst damage happens. It will help you pump some healing into you DPS, especially your TANK in the front lines.\n\nAnother ability to get is  [Eye of Horus](item_169551ce-e4e5-4a14-9ec4-abdc25673939) . This item will save your team mates from a far when it they're low health. This will allow you to send nano from 60 meter and through walls. Yes THROUGH WALLS. I can not stress how many times you come from spawn and need to save your team mates. Well you can from 60 meters just nano the team and yourself. The other team might be mad though.",
