            "notes": "Round 5 this is good because you get another power. \n\nThis power should be  [Home Remedy](item_de68ba66-26d5-4136-a0c1-6396d3f1b0c7) . This can grant over health that will equal to the amount of HP a hero has on your team. This can save your team mates by giving over (which is temp health) when you're healing them.\n\nFor abilities you can have one or the other you can have  [Cluster Core](item_c63cd7ba-b71c-4503-bdb6-4ef0b0a4bdbb) which can reduce the amount of time you have to use again by two seconds. Which means more up time on the healing and the grenade, or you can have  [Grenadius Pin](item_acd985cf-2e74-4e18-8fad-cdaa0837fc78) which can up the radius of the splash which can help Anti the other team or get's everyone on your team if they're close to each other.",
