            "notes": "Round 7 everything is intense now but for you as an Ana not really because the kit is so potent you don't really have to think about it. \n\nFor power can have two of them as your choice. \n\nOne of the powers is  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) this will allow you to gain attack speed for two seconds, when you are not scoped in. This pairs good with  [Potent Projectiles](item_7e9a8017-9458-4318-aea9-5e80ba7e3c46) since the size has been increased. You can pump a lot of healing when this happens and save your tank or anyone really. Plus you don't have to waste a ability slot for attack speed. \n\nThe other power you can get is  [Tactical Rifle](item_683d8145-a13e-4ea8-997b-0ed2151b1cac) . This allows you to auto aim at team mates and will always hit with less  movement speed. As well if you don't feel confident about the aim which I don't blame you since everything is going around and getting crazy, we all need some assistance with our aim. So why not be a Solider 76 and but lock on to your team mates and heal with the rifle\n\nAbilities wise: I have  [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) to ignore 50% of the armor's damage reduction if you want some weapon power",
